  m_text: "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAN
    UNFINISHED GAME\n\nDeveloped by\nSlafurry Studios\n\n\nTEAMS\n\nProject Manager\n-
    Muhammad Zaini\n\nUnity Programmers\n- Muhammad Zaini\n- Muhamad Rizal\n\nGame
    Designer\n- Muhammad Zaini\n\nLevel Designer\n- Muhamad Rizal\n\n2D Artist\n-
    Muhammad Kahil Deiryl Kiefe Moesliem\n\nUI Designer\n- Muhammad Kahil Deiryl
    Kiefe Moesliem\n\nAudio Engineer\n- Muhammad Raifan Syifa Dien\n\nNarrative Designer\n-
    Niken Qinata Rahayu\n\n\nSPECIAL THANKS\n\n- csw\n- Dina Varya\n- Nisa Rizqiya
    Fadhliana, S.Kom., M.T.\n\n\nSLAFURRY STUDIOS\n\nSpecial thanks to all Slafurry
    Studios members who supported us throughout this 12/100 Game Jam journey.\n\n-
    Faiz2979\n- americano\n- ModDiv\n- Kayzu\n- CarteChia\n- Rafif\n- Dann\n- SoftPotatoes\n-
    Rinka\n- cheerful\n- Ifanitas\n- LUEM\n- Cyan cyret\n- \u30A2\u30EB\u30AB\u30C7\u30F3\n-
    nop-\n- InSesth\n- Erick_Patin\n- RoYunTo\n- boji21\n- TiramissuCake\n- Cumulonimbus\n-
    CrispySpinach\n- Asura\n\n\nThis game was not made by one person.\n\nEvery idea,
    contribution, feedback, and support helped bring this project to life.\n\nThank
    you for being part of this unfinished journey."
